{"path":"/ja/tip/20-11","title":"大型用品は「借りる、中古を買う、新品を買う」の順で検討し、一度に揃えようとしない | HowToLiveBetter","description":"ベビーカー、おくるみ、おもちゃは使用期間が短いので、まず借り、次に中古、最後に新品を検討します。中古チャイルドシートは中度以上の事故歴なし、リコール対象外、部品完備を確認し、不明なら使いません。他の家庭の中古マットレスは乳幼児突然死リスク約3倍との関連があるため、マットレスは新品を勧めます。","lang":"ja","styles":["/sites/howtolivebetter/styles/bca54bebe9c1bd3b.css"],"bodyClass":"font-sans antialiased","nodes":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-site"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-slot","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"header","props":{"className":"life-header"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-inner"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-brand","aria-label":"H ✳ HowToLiveBetter ホーム","href":"/ja"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-brand-mark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["H",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["✳"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["HowToLive",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Better"]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-nav","aria-label":"メインナビゲーション"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/book"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["本を読む"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["厳選50"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/daily"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["今日のタスク"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/dashboard"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["マイリスト"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-nav-link life-nav-more","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["その他"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":